: Written by hand from the AG-UI specification, not recorded: the result of the parent's call closes it, a state event of the parent leaves a subagent's call open, and MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT closes every call, so the chunks that follow, tagged only when they open a call, continue the only call left open.
